                                    <div class="text-[10px] text-[#94A3B8] mt-1 font-mono" data-i18n="checkout.crypto_trc20_detail">
                                        Jaringan TRON. Standar utama deposit/penarikan Binance, OKX, Bybit, Indodax, Tokocrypto.
                                    </div>
